{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2023-03-15 06:00:00', 'title': 'GOOGLE SELECTS FASTLY OBLIVIOUS HTTP RELAY FOR PRIVACY SANDBOX INITIATIVE TO ENHANCE ONLINE PRIVACY FOR BILLIONS OF CHROME USERS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FASTLY, INC. (NYSE: FSLY), THE WORLD'S FASTEST GLOBAL EDGE CLOUD PLATFORM, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH GOOGLE LLC (NASDAQ: GOOGL) TO OPERATE AN OBLIVIOUS HTTP RELAY (OHTTP RELAY) AS PART OF FLEDGE, THE PRIVACY SANDBOX INITIATIVE TO IMPROVE PRIVACY WHILE CONTINUING TO SUPPORT TAILORED ADVERTISING."}